ExactFillSettler_openFor
├── when originFillerData is empty bytes
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOriginFillerData
├── when the EOA signature is valid
│   ├── it should transition status from None to Opened and emit Open
│   └── it should record repaymentTo from originFillerData
├── when the ERC-1271 signature is valid
│   └── it should behave identically to the EOA path
├── when the signature is invalid
│   └── it should revert with InvalidSignature
├── when orderData.allowPartialFills is true
│   └── it should revert with InconsistentIntent
├── when srcCstToken equals premiumToken
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOrderTokenPair
├── when status is already Opened
│   └── it should no-op idempotently and not emit Open again
├── when status is Settled or Refunded or Cancelled
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOrderStatus
└── when a rollover fillRecord exists before openFor lands
    └── it should still transition to Opened and bind the recorded fillRecord.filler as the rolloverFiller precedence
